  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under the Restatement (Third) of Agency, Section 8.05, an agent owes a duty of loyalty that prohibits using confidential information obtained during the agency for personal profit. Harper exploited inside knowledge of Baxter''s acquisition plans to purchase adjacent land for personal gain, breaching this fiduciary obligation.
